WEBVTT

00:18.330 --> 00:21.580
<b>We broke</b>

00:20.700 --> 00:23.620
<b>Everything that was right</b>

00:22.750 --> 00:26.460
<b>We both enjoyed a good fight</b>

00:26.170 --> 00:29.460
<b>And we solved</b>

00:28.590 --> 00:31.380
<b>All the holes we had to breathe</b>

00:30.510 --> 00:34.430
<b>To make the other one leave</b>

00:34.010 --> 00:37.300
<b>And I loved</b>

00:36.390 --> 00:40.430
<b>The way you looked at me</b>

00:41.640 --> 00:45.060
<b>And I miss</b>

00:44.190 --> 00:48.020
<b>The way you made me feel</b>

00:47.150 --> 00:50.440
<b>When we were alone</b>

00:51.190 --> 00:54.570
<b>When we were alone</b>

00:55.570 --> 01:02.580
<b>And I'll shiver like I used to</b>

01:03.450 --> 01:09.960
<b>And I'll leave him just for you</b>

01:11.210 --> 01:18.180
<b>And I'll shiver like I used to</b>

01:15.510 --> 01:30.610
Mushi-Shi

01:15.510 --> 01:30.610
Mushi-Shi

01:18.550 --> 01:25.850
<b>Just for you</b>

01:26.440 --> 01:33.370
<b>Like I used to</b>

01:37.160 --> 01:39.990
<b>They seem strange and alien.</b>

01:40.830 --> 01:42.330
<b>Primitive and peculiar,</b>

01:42.990 --> 01:48.040
<b>they are unlike any flora or fauna known to us.</b>

01:48.960 --> 01:51.460
<b>From time immemorial,</b>

01:51.460 --> 01:54.460
<b>men have feared these misshapen entities,</b>

01:55.260 --> 01:59.590
<b>which came to be known as "mushi."</b>

01:56.470 --> 02:02.390
Mushi

01:56.470 --> 02:02.390
Mushi

02:28.750 --> 02:30.080
<b>Grandfather...</b>

02:30.790 --> 02:32.210
<b>where are we going?</b>

02:34.840 --> 02:39.180
<b>We're traveling to the place that will be your home for the foreseeable future.</b>

02:43.050 --> 02:48.100
<b>Until you can finally see them,
you must not set foot outside of it.</b>

02:49.810 --> 02:51.150
<b>Am I clear?</b>

02:54.070 --> 02:57.610
<b>If you must resent something, resent your blood.</b>

02:59.490 --> 03:01.280
<b>Curse the dark.</b>

03:03.030 --> 03:05.080
<b>And hate the mushi.</b>

03:07.160 --> 03:13.170
m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100

03:07.160 --> 03:13.170
Path of Overgrowth

04:04.550 --> 04:08.470
<b>Let's see, here it is.</b>

04:10.270 --> 04:12.690
<b>Here. That what you need?</b>

04:16.810 --> 04:18.520
<b>Yeah. This is it.</b>

04:19.110 --> 04:20.610
<b>You always have the good stuff.</b>

04:20.610 --> 04:22.240
<b>Thanks.</b>

04:24.570 --> 04:25.740
<b>One more thing.</b>

04:26.820 --> 04:28.950
<b>I also came here to ask about something.</b>

04:31.370 --> 04:35.080
<b>Rumor has it that mushi have been behaving erratically on the nearby mountain.</b>

04:39.630 --> 04:42.340
<b>Could you tell me more about that?</b>

04:44.630 --> 04:48.760
<b>The head of the main family's already investigating it.</b>

04:49.890 --> 04:53.680
<b>This here is Minai clan territory.</b>

04:53.680 --> 04:56.770
<b>It's best if outsider mushi-shi just stay out of it.</b>

05:01.910 --> 05:04.490
<b>I was given this letter, though.</b>

05:30.970 --> 05:32.390
<b>The outlying village?</b>

05:34.600 --> 05:37.060
<b>It used to be just down this road.</b>

05:37.730 --> 05:40.190
<b>But it's deserted now.</b>

05:43.690 --> 05:47.280
<b>A while back, the land over there became completely barren.</b>

06:31.120 --> 06:33.370
<b>A bit strange, don't you think?</b>

06:39.960 --> 06:43.960
<b>How the dead flora here has suddenly come back to life, I mean.</b>

06:46.460 --> 06:49.010
<b>I've never seen anything quite like it.</b>

06:50.970 --> 06:52.350
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

06:53.430 --> 06:55.510
<b>We Minai will take care of this matter ourselves.</b>

06:56.020 --> 06:57.890
<b>Don't stick your nose where it doesn't belong.</b>

06:58.480 --> 07:01.100
<b>You may be the oldest mushi-shi clan,</b>

07:01.100 --> 07:03.770
<b>but that doesn't give you the right to monopolize any matter.</b>

07:06.400 --> 07:07.610
<b>That hair...</b>

07:08.320 --> 07:10.910
<b>You must be that Ginko fellow.</b>

07:12.240 --> 07:15.200
<b>I've heard about you from Tama, the servant of the Karibusa clan.</b>

07:15.870 --> 07:19.250
<b>You seem particularly attached to mushi.</b>

07:22.440 --> 07:23.770
<b>How absurd.</b>

07:25.360 --> 07:27.300
<b>Halfheartedness isn't welcome here.</b>

07:27.300 --> 07:28.210
<b>Begone.</b>

07:31.930 --> 07:33.680
<b>Aren't <i>you</i> the halfhearted ones?</b>

07:36.510 --> 07:37.560
<b>What was that?</b>

07:38.560 --> 07:41.190
<b>I hear your clan is only interested in one type of mushi.</b>

07:42.520 --> 07:44.560
<b>Perhaps that's what has her concerned.</b>

07:45.360 --> 07:47.980
<b>I was asked to oversee this investigation, you see.</b>

07:54.200 --> 08:04.210
<b>The person entrusted with this letter has been sent</b>

07:54.200 --> 08:04.210
<b>The person entrusted with this letter has been sent</b>

07:54.200 --> 08:04.210
<b>to assist the head of the Minai clan with his investigation.</b>

07:54.200 --> 08:04.210
<b>to assist the head of the Minai clan with his investigation.</b>

07:56.780 --> 07:59.410
<b>It's unbelievable how whimsical Tanyuu-dono is sometimes.</b>

07:59.950 --> 08:02.370
<b>It's like she's completely unaware of her situation.</b>

08:05.330 --> 08:07.000
<b>Must be nice being so carefree.</b>

08:36.780 --> 08:42.250
<b>I received word that the fourth scribe of the Karibusa clan has been born.</b>

08:45.370 --> 08:52.010
<b>They are the family we have been serving for centuries.</b>

08:55.430 --> 09:02.060
<b>Long ago, during the great cataclysm,
a strange type of mushi appeared before us.</b>

09:04.940 --> 09:10.860
<b>At a time when all other living beings and mushi were rotting away, this mushi possessed great power.</b>

09:12.650 --> 09:16.360
<b>It sought to use that power to kill all other life-forms.</b>

09:17.200 --> 09:19.030
<b>We dubbed it "The Forbidden Mushi."</b>

09:21.120 --> 09:27.830
<b>The one who finally put a stop to it
was our ancestor, a Minai mushi-shi.</b>

09:30.630 --> 09:36.340
<b>However, in order to do so,
he had to seal it in a person.</b>

09:38.550 --> 09:44.770
<b>A member of the Karibusa clan consented to becoming the mushi's container.</b>

09:46.980 --> 09:52.900
<b>But the mushi continued to be passed down along the Karibusa bloodline,</b>

09:54.240 --> 09:58.030
<b>and to this day, it still
binds their bodies.</b>

10:01.580 --> 10:09.830
<b>We must find a way to eradicate this mushi as quickly as possible.</b>

10:11.420 --> 10:21.600
<b>Otherwise, it might reemerge the
moment another cataclysm strikes.</b>

10:24.430 --> 10:30.020
<b>Unfortunately, no one knows its true form anymore.</b>

10:32.400 --> 10:37.070
<b>Your father,
and his father before him,</b>

10:37.070 --> 10:40.210
<b>spent their entire lives
investigating this mushi.</b>

10:42.280 --> 10:43.660
<b>Kumado, my boy...</b>

10:45.370 --> 10:48.460
<b>you must inherit their will.</b>

10:51.710 --> 10:54.250
<b>But, I am...</b>

10:55.250 --> 10:58.420
<b>...unable to see mushi.</b>

11:00.760 --> 11:04.890
<b>Even Father called me pathetic because of it.</b>

11:06.560 --> 11:10.520
<b>You will be able to see them soon enough.</b>

11:13.520 --> 11:17.990
<b>You'll be able to if you remain here,
whether you want to or not.</b>

11:22.280 --> 11:25.280
<b>This is no ordinary place.</b>

11:31.250 --> 11:34.080
<b>It is called a "Path of Overgrowth."</b>

11:35.000 --> 11:38.840
<b>It is one of the routes mushi take to burst forth from the earth.</b>

11:44.300 --> 11:48.350
<b>This place is on the border between our world and the mushi's world.</b>

11:55.900 --> 11:59.190
<b>You must never stray too far down this path.</b>

12:00.570 --> 12:05.240
<b>If you do, you'll never be the same again.</b>

12:34.900 --> 12:37.230
<b>They're really starting to multiply.</b>

12:38.190 --> 12:40.480
<b>I'm seeing many of them
for the first time.</b>

12:42.440 --> 12:43.490
<b>What is <i>that</i>?</b>

12:46.120 --> 12:48.330
<b>I'd like to catch some of these.</b>

12:48.330 --> 12:49.870
<b>Do whatever you want.</b>

13:20.650 --> 13:21.570
<b>What is this?</b>

13:23.440 --> 13:24.820
<b>A Path of Overgrowth.</b>

13:25.950 --> 13:29.830
<b>Why here? There's not even a Koumyaku{River of Light} here.</b>

13:32.290 --> 13:33.450
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

13:33.450 --> 13:35.120
<b>I'm going inside to check things out.</b>

13:37.460 --> 13:38.420
<b>What's the matter?</b>

13:39.130 --> 13:40.590
<b>Getting cold feet, are we?</b>

13:42.170 --> 13:44.590
<b>No one would <i>willingly</i> set foot in a Path of Overgrowth.</b>

13:45.470 --> 13:47.010
<b>Well, if you ask me,</b>

13:47.680 --> 13:50.010
<b>it feels just like home.</b>

13:53.520 --> 13:56.100
<b>Oh... Is that so?</b>

13:59.190 --> 14:00.110
<b>That's...</b>

14:01.520 --> 14:02.650
<b>quite unfortunate.</b>

14:27.970 --> 14:32.100
<b>How long has it been since I came to live in this place?</b>

14:43.980 --> 14:45.110
<b>The darkness...</b>

14:45.780 --> 14:47.070
<b>It's shaking!</b>

15:17.390 --> 15:20.020
<b>I still can't see them, but I feel a presence all around me.</b>

15:21.560 --> 15:26.190
<b>I feel them looking at me all the time!</b>

15:30.320 --> 15:33.200
<b>Are those things... mushi?</b>

15:34.910 --> 15:36.870
<b>No, they are not.</b>

15:38.910 --> 15:41.460
<b>Those are manifestations of your fears.</b>

15:41.460 --> 15:45.130
<b>They are but mere illusions created by your mind.</b>

15:47.500 --> 15:53.260
<b>You have not yet awakened your five senses.</b>

15:57.260 --> 16:00.850
<b>However, it's only a matter of time now.</b>

16:02.900 --> 16:08.610
<b>Soon, the shackles that bind you shall disappear.</b>

16:10.940 --> 16:13.320
<b>Shackles?</b>

16:16.580 --> 16:19.870
<b>How should I put it?</b>

16:23.920 --> 16:29.840
<b>Perhaps it would be most accurate to call those shackles... your soul.</b>

16:34.930 --> 16:37.930
<b>But if my soul disappears,</b>

16:39.520 --> 16:42.270
<b>will I even still be alive?</b>

16:46.690 --> 16:47.940
<b>Not to worry.</b>

16:51.570 --> 16:54.660
<b>I will replace it with something else.</b>

17:11.590 --> 17:15.880
<b>Eventually, I stopped seeing the illusions.</b>

17:24.020 --> 17:29.400
<b>I became engulfed by that darkness, all the way down to my dreams.</b>

18:55.730 --> 18:57.070
<b>Forgive me.</b>

18:59.980 --> 19:01.570
<b>Please forgive me!</b>

19:59.290 --> 20:01.930
<b>What is...</b>

20:01.930 --> 20:03.770
<b>...this scent?</b>

20:06.300 --> 20:08.310
<b>It's strangely sweet...</b>

20:10.140 --> 20:12.130
<b>and yet also bitter.</b>

20:25.270 --> 20:27.370
<b>Have you come to?</b>

20:29.040 --> 20:31.660
<b>Do you recognize me?</b>

20:35.710 --> 20:36.790
<b>Good.</b>

21:18.590 --> 21:21.800
<b>Yes, feast your eyes upon them at last.</b>

21:25.800 --> 21:28.350
<b>This is what a Path of Overgrowth</b>

21:29.680 --> 21:31.810
<b>and the entire world</b>

21:31.810 --> 21:33.810
<b>truly look like.</b>

21:49.830 --> 21:50.950
<b>Found it.</b>

21:52.870 --> 21:55.660
<b>If it'd make you feel more comfortable, you can wait here.</b>

22:03.880 --> 22:05.760
<b>Everything he says gets on my nerves.</b>

22:18.400 --> 22:22.900
<b>I suspect you two won't get along, but could you please go and help him out?</b>

22:25.690 --> 22:28.950
<b>I don't know who else to ask.</b>

22:30.320 --> 22:35.830
<b>Minai mushi-shi sometimes seem like they're lacking a certain something.</b>

22:38.920 --> 22:41.330
<b>Tama won't say a word about it,</b>

22:42.670 --> 22:46.010
<b>but I'm sure it's because they've gone through immense pain and suffering...</b>

22:49.890 --> 22:52.350
<b>all because of the mushi sealed right here.</b>

22:56.730 --> 23:00.060
<b>I have a bad feeling this time, though.</b>

23:06.070 --> 23:09.910
<b>Won't you please go help him out and make sure he doesn't do anything reckless?</b>

23:26.920 --> 23:28.550
<b>Guess I've got no other choice.</b>

23:49.030 --> 23:51.110
<b>Tanyuu-ojousama?</b>

23:52.030 --> 23:56.620
<b>This is the man who is to succeed as the head of the Minai clan.</b>

23:57.450 --> 23:59.620
<b>His name is Kumado.</b>

24:06.540 --> 24:10.970
<b>Perhaps because she wanted to help us, since we were similar in age and had no friends,</b>

24:11.760 --> 24:15.640
<b>Tama often invited Kumado to our mansion.</b>

24:22.350 --> 24:24.520
<b>Where'd you go this time?</b>

24:24.980 --> 24:26.940
<b>I went to the west coast.</b>

24:26.940 --> 24:28.650
<b>Did you bring me any souvenirs?</b>

24:28.650 --> 24:29.530
<b>Yes.</b>

24:32.200 --> 24:33.660
<b>Wow!</b>

24:34.860 --> 24:36.910
<b>They're all different shapes and sizes!</b>

24:39.910 --> 24:41.660
<b>What's this one?</b>

24:43.210 --> 24:45.080
<b>I didn't know there was an agate in there.</b>

24:46.630 --> 24:50.670
<b>Are you sure you want to give me something this pretty?</b>

24:51.550 --> 24:52.470
<b>Take it.</b>

24:53.630 --> 24:56.050
<b>I don't really care either way.</b>

25:02.480 --> 25:04.350
<b>Hey, Tama?</b>

25:05.730 --> 25:09.610
<b>Does Kumado hate me or something?</b>

25:10.730 --> 25:13.900
<b>I've never seen him smile.
Not even once.</b>

25:16.740 --> 25:24.790
<b>Due to his harsh upbringing,
that boy's soul has grown cold.</b>

25:25.920 --> 25:29.590
<b>However, given time,</b>

25:29.590 --> 25:32.510
<b>I'm certain that warmth will flow into it again.</b>

25:33.760 --> 25:37.970
<b>Please, don't hold it against him.</b>

25:42.100 --> 25:43.350
<b>Really?</b>

25:43.350 --> 25:47.310
<b>It must've been really tough to cross that mountain range!</b>

25:49.190 --> 25:54.860
<b>But you know, I bet the view from the summit made it all worth it.</b>

25:56.240 --> 25:57.320
<b>Not really.</b>

25:58.270 --> 26:00.200
<b>You can just see really far.</b>

26:07.790 --> 26:12.670
<b>Meanwhile, I've never even seen what lies beyond that hill.</b>

26:15.800 --> 26:21.550
<b>If I told you I was a little envious of you,
would that make you mad?</b>

26:23.260 --> 26:27.640
<b>If you went to the other side of that hill, you'd find that there's nothing special there either.</b>

26:29.060 --> 26:33.190
<b>No matter where you go, you'll wind up feeling the same way.</b>

27:22.320 --> 27:23.950
<b>So you're up here after all.</b>

27:27.620 --> 27:29.320
<b>Kuma-dono,</b>

27:29.320 --> 27:30.790
<b>you were right.</b>

27:35.250 --> 27:38.590
<b>No matter where I run to, everything's the same.</b>

28:31.020 --> 28:32.310
<b>Pretty, isn't it?</b>

28:44.700 --> 28:45.530
<b>Indeed.</b>

28:48.700 --> 28:52.410
<b>However, some time later,</b>

28:52.410 --> 28:55.630
<b>I came to see Kumado as a
completely different person.</b>

29:01.800 --> 29:04.090
<b>His appearance hadn't changed any,</b>

29:04.800 --> 29:07.470
<b>but I still couldn't help but feel he was a stranger.</b>

29:09.640 --> 29:10.680
<b>Kumado?</b>

29:12.140 --> 29:14.310
<b>Are you sure it's you, Kumado?</b>

29:16.440 --> 29:17.190
<b>Yes.</b>

29:19.690 --> 29:22.440
<b>It's me, all right.</b>

29:58.150 --> 30:01.270
<b>This path doesn't seem too old.</b>

30:06.660 --> 30:08.210
<b>Look at the exit.</b>

30:08.210 --> 30:09.700
<b>It's still open.</b>

30:10.490 --> 30:13.240
<b>There should have been a Koumyaku{River of Light} here by now.</b>

30:14.000 --> 30:16.710
<b>It must be due to the lack of a mushi lord to conceal the exit.</b>

30:17.460 --> 30:20.350
<b>Well, this explains the state of that deserted village.</b>

30:22.420 --> 30:27.220
<b>A Path of Overgrowth, if left open, would blur
the border between mushi and living organisms.</b>

30:28.720 --> 30:32.390
<b>Within that outlying village, death is no longer definite.</b>

30:35.390 --> 30:38.520
<b>And if this exit gets any bigger,</b>

30:39.730 --> 30:43.650
<b>the balance of life is going to come crashing down.</b>

30:46.150 --> 30:47.820
<b>A cataclysm, huh?</b>

30:51.620 --> 30:52.740
<b>What are you planning to do?!</b>

30:54.740 --> 30:57.250
<b>We have but one job.</b>

30:58.210 --> 31:01.750
<b>This may be an omen foretelling the reemergence of the Forbidden Mushi.</b>

31:02.960 --> 31:06.800
<b>Indeed, it's even possible that it has already reappeared at the end of this path.</b>

31:07.970 --> 31:10.260
<b>If that's the case, we must go and stop it now.</b>

31:13.220 --> 31:15.890
<b>Before anything else,
we have to close this exit!</b>

31:15.890 --> 31:18.140
<b>The sooner we cut off the mushi's influence, the better.</b>

31:18.140 --> 31:19.020
<b>Please help me out!</b>

31:19.480 --> 31:23.230
<b>If we can prevent a cataclysm from occurring, the Forbidden Mushi won't appear.</b>

31:23.230 --> 31:25.020
<b>So sealing this place off comes first!</b>

31:27.490 --> 31:32.530
<b>In order to fulfill my clan's duty, I threw away everything...</b>

31:33.910 --> 31:39.660
<b>all for some elusive mushi of legend that never appears.</b>

31:42.040 --> 31:45.960
<b>At this point, I <i>want</i> it to show up.</b>

32:01.100 --> 32:04.440
<b>Something huge... is back there.</b>

32:06.820 --> 32:09.570
<b>Wait! What do you think you'll accomplish by yourself?!</b>

32:10.950 --> 32:11.700
<b>Hey!</b>

32:14.780 --> 32:16.200
<b>He's being so reckless.</b>

32:16.200 --> 32:17.490
<b>Does he have a death wish?</b>

32:24.290 --> 32:26.380
<b>The exit's already gotten bigger.</b>

32:49.980 --> 32:51.610
<b>The mushi have disappeared.</b>

33:10.050 --> 33:11.460
<b>A mushi corpse?</b>

33:14.510 --> 33:15.380
<b>No...</b>

33:16.010 --> 33:17.300
<b>It's still alive.</b>

33:18.930 --> 33:20.640
<b>But the state that it's in...</b>

34:12.190 --> 34:16.700
<b>What are you swarming all over me for?</b>

34:19.030 --> 34:20.700
<b>Search me all you want.</b>

34:22.030 --> 34:25.290
<b>You'll never find what you're looking for, though.</b>

34:29.080 --> 34:33.670
<b>I already gave it to you a long time ago.</b>

34:38.800 --> 34:39.720
<b>Are you all right?!</b>

34:44.930 --> 34:45.980
<b>Run!</b>

34:46.480 --> 34:47.980
<b>Or they'll take your soul!</b>

35:02.910 --> 35:04.250
<b>It's so cold.</b>

35:06.370 --> 35:08.160
<b>It feels like...</b>

35:08.960 --> 35:11.330
<b>...a freezing wind...</b>

35:11.330 --> 35:13.140
<b>...is blowing throughout my body.</b>

35:27.980 --> 35:29.280
<b>Where am I?</b>

35:30.900 --> 35:32.200
<b>What is this place?</b>

35:37.780 --> 35:38.990
<b>Is that...</b>

35:41.170 --> 35:42.370
<b>...me?</b>

35:54.210 --> 35:55.840
<b>The moon again?</b>

35:59.220 --> 36:01.970
<b>Didn't it set already, though?</b>

36:18.530 --> 36:19.440
<b>You fool.</b>

36:20.780 --> 36:22.200
<b>Why did you follow me?</b>

37:15.350 --> 37:16.950
<b>I finally...</b>

37:18.250 --> 37:19.900
<b>...made it out of the woods.</b>

37:33.480 --> 37:34.790
<b>This is...</b>

37:50.530 --> 37:52.520
<b>Tanyuu?</b>

37:52.520 --> 37:54.040
<b>But that's...</b>

37:56.490 --> 37:59.420
<b>...what she looked like...</b>

37:59.420 --> 38:01.250
<b>...a long time ago.</b>

38:06.790 --> 38:07.930
<b>Pretty, isn't it?</b>

38:41.850 --> 38:43.960
<b>What the hell is that?</b>

38:51.050 --> 38:53.100
<b>His soul is missing.</b>

39:05.080 --> 39:08.610
<b>Did that thing... save us?</b>

39:13.030 --> 39:16.950
<b>What <i>was</i> that... just now?</b>

39:37.390 --> 39:40.640
<b>Good work, Ginko.</b>

39:42.150 --> 39:46.780
<b>We'll pay you later, so would you mind leaving for now?</b>

39:49.780 --> 39:53.950
<b>It seems the Minai mushi-shi have gotten involved with something crazy.</b>

39:56.260 --> 40:00.250
<b>That thing was an artificial mushi made from kouki.</b>

40:04.630 --> 40:08.960
<b>You use it as the substitute for someone's soul and then make them go after mushi.</b>

40:08.960 --> 40:11.180
<b>And if it ever gets out,
you replace it with another.</b>

40:13.550 --> 40:17.680
<b>Are you really making your family repeat such a process?</b>

40:20.230 --> 40:22.020
<b>If we don't,</b>

40:23.060 --> 40:26.190
<b>there is a path we won't be able to progress down.</b>

40:44.080 --> 40:53.630
<b>Beings that shuffle along this mortal coil even after having lost their souls...</b>

40:57.550 --> 41:02.390
<b>What could they be?</b>

41:13.650 --> 41:18.740
<b>Who could they be?</b>

41:45.890 --> 41:47.100
<b>I owe you my thanks.</b>

41:48.270 --> 41:51.780
<b>If it weren't for you, I would've lost my soul too.</b>

41:54.400 --> 41:58.910
<b>I just hate those Sanekui mushi, is all.</b>

42:01.240 --> 42:02.040
<b>Is that so?</b>

42:09.080 --> 42:11.170
<b>Sorry for making you wait.</b>

42:34.320 --> 42:38.860
<b>So then, you finally closed the exit to that Path of Overgrowth?</b>

42:40.070 --> 42:42.950
<b>More or less. I made some temporary repairs.</b>

42:44.580 --> 42:50.500
<b>It was a sort of emergency exit that the mushi created in order to escape the massive outbreak of Sanekui mushi.</b>

42:51.670 --> 42:55.460
<b>Providing that the Sanekui mushi go back to normal, the exit will be sealed in time.</b>

42:56.670 --> 42:58.280
<b>Sanekui, or "core-eating" mushi...</b>

43:00.140 --> 43:03.970
<b>They're mushi that reside in a Path of Overgrowth and devour souls, right?</b>

43:06.520 --> 43:09.850
<b>Can you think of any reasons
behind their massive outbreak?</b>

43:11.690 --> 43:13.900
<b>Not yet, no.</b>

43:15.860 --> 43:21.240
<b>I can only guess that it's another of the mushi abnormalities 
that have occurred within the last twenty years.</b>

43:23.910 --> 43:25.830
<b>Do you believe it to be a bad omen?</b>

43:28.290 --> 43:30.080
<b>I can't say for sure.</b>

43:31.750 --> 43:35.880
<b>In the end, I still couldn't find out anything about the Forbidden Mushi.</b>

43:40.220 --> 43:42.090
<b>You needn't rush, you know.</b>

43:43.760 --> 43:49.430
<b>I'm quite prepared to spend the rest of my life with this mushi.</b>

43:54.400 --> 43:55.690
<b>Hey, Kumado...</b>

43:57.570 --> 44:01.610
<b>Even if nothing ever changes,</b>

44:03.580 --> 44:05.510
<b>we are not alone.</b>

44:10.140 --> 44:12.080
<b>Not in the least.</b>

44:31.580 --> 44:32.680
<b>Does it taste good?</b>

44:34.790 --> 44:36.110
<b>Beats me.</b>

44:37.420 --> 44:39.330
<b>Of course it does!</b>

44:39.330 --> 44:40.880
<b>Here, you can have some too.</b>

44:40.880 --> 44:41.610
<b>Thanks.</b>

44:42.820 --> 44:44.620
<b>This is what "delicious" tastes like.</b>

44:44.620 --> 44:46.870
<b>You know, you're being
pretty forceful.</b>

44:47.490 --> 44:48.620
<b>Quiet, you.</b>

44:49.800 --> 44:52.350
<b>Also, are you sure this is "delicious"?</b>

44:53.040 --> 44:56.080
<b>You really don't have a taste for the finer things, do you?</b>

44:56.080 --> 44:57.500
<b>That's pretty rude of you.</b>

44:58.250 --> 45:00.460
<b>It's just a matter of personal preference.</b>

45:02.050 --> 45:03.570
<b>Is that so?</b>

47:15.100 --> 47:16.940
<b>Path 
of 
Overgrowth</b>

47:15.100 --> 47:20.100
<b>Cushion 
of 
Grass</b>

47:16.600 --> 47:18.480
<b>"Cushion of Grass."</b>
